anche più forte!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Evitiamo di litigare, OK? Ahahahah!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0013:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}You're almost undetectable today!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0012:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}I mean, look at what you're wearing!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
